Subject: [PATCH 86/91] Client titles for 47 more missions

Pages that cover a whole chain, or don't say which part they are, now get
the client title of the chain's first part, or of the part the page
names. A few take the client's spelling (Fathers and Sons, Location,
Location, Mordu's Folly, Eliminate a Pirate Nuisance).

Seven still have no client title that clearly matches and keep their
plain name: Angel Strike, Intaki and Mordus Legion, Khanid Nobleman, Labor
of Love, Smash The Shipyard, The Kidnapping and Troop Build Up.
